<title>CHINA: China Jan-June cotton imports up 14 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June cotton imports up 14 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 460,000 tonnes of cotton in the first half of this year, up 14 percent from the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Cotton    460,000	    70,000	  +14.0</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Cotton	  193		182	   -90.1</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532 1921 Fax; 10-6532-4978</p>
</text>
